9244363,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pAlXL","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"I've confirmed that it's working as expected.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"529\" height=\"320\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec3bed76-7084-46a4-ad4e-d47bf29cd95f\" />\r\n\r\nI'll add the `brakes compat` label just in case, as it involves a minor breaking change; As long as `disable_deprecated` is `false`, it will issue a warning but won't break the project.\r\n\r\nI'll confirm the final agreement later in the animation meeting.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369#pullrequestreview-3909244363","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-07T18:08:59Z"},{"id":3909537322,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pBs4q","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369#pullrequestreview-3909537322","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-07T20:10:09Z"},{"id":3909607894,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pB-HW","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","login":"lyuma","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma"},"body":"We discussed this at the animation meeting, but it was difficult to find consensus.\n\nBlendPoint name is StringName, not String. The APIs to `set_blend_point_name` and `get_blend_point_name` and `find_blend_point_by_name` should take StringName.\n\nTokage notes: The compatibility impact is when the number of points is changed dynamically at runtime, so people who need this can use `get_blend_point_name`\n\n@fire commented during the meeting that this is not something we need, and changing it from an integer to string and having an editable title might be a bad idea.\n\nI and fire agree it may be helpful to have the index number visible at least.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369#pullrequestreview-3909607894","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-07T20:49:50Z"},{"id":3911732214,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pKEv2","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?u=083ae75d5d2e2e8bbace52715ec4ac911bcf7554&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","login":"vaner-org","type":"User","